      "negative": "Unknown quest NOT_FOUND, forbidden current authority FORBIDDEN. Attributed payment for currently nonclosed quest INTERNAL. Inject decision, entitlement, ledger or claim-binding failure, assert whole respective UOW rollback and no replay receipt. No reason/timestamp/absence inference or historical FK invention.",
